    "instructions": "Summarize the conversation below for your own later use: what was asked, what was decided, what is still open, and any names, numbers or preferences worth keeping. Write plain prose, under 300 words, and nothing else.",
    "stub": "The tests summarize with a stub that answers \"[stub summary of N lines]\" where N is the transcript's line count.",
    "cases": [
      {
        "case": "under the threshold nothing changes",
        "threshold": 1000,
        "keep": 2,
        "messages": [
